<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>HymnBridge</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles/style.css">

<body>
    <div class="container">
        <header class="header">
            <h1>&#9836; HymnBridge</h1>
            <p class="text">A living archive of cultural songs & sacred music from around the world</p>
        </header>

        <nav class="links">
            <a href="/">Home</a>
            <a href="/search">Search Music</a>
            <a href="/entries">Saved Entries</a>
            <a href="/entries/new">Add Entry</a>
        </nav>

        <main class="home">
            <div class="welcome">
                <h2>Welcome to HymnBridge</h2>

                <p>
                    HymnBridge is a personal archive where you can search for cultural hymns,
                    folk songs, and sacred music from around the world — then save your favorites
                    with a personal reflection.
                </p>

                <div class="buttons">
                    <a class="button" href="/search">&#128269; Search for Music</a>

                    <a class="button2" href="/entries">&#128196; View Saved Entries</a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="about">
                <h3>What you can do here</h3>

                <ul>
                    <li>Search YouTube for hymns, folk songs, and cultural music</li>
                    <li>Save songs you love with a personal reflection</li>
                    <li>Browse and manage your saved collection</li>
                    <li>Add entries manually with a title, artist, link, and category</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </main>

        <footer class="footer">
            <div class="bottom">
                <a href="/">&copy; HymnBridge &mdash; Preserving Songs Across Cultures</a>
            </div>
        </footer>
    </div>
</body>
</html>